            "text": "theorem rotationMap_jets {a b : ℝ} (ha : 0 < a) (m : ℕ) :\n    ∃ C : ℝ, 1 ≤ C ∧ ∀ x ∈ cylindricalDomain a b, ∀ j ≤ m,\n      ‖iteratedFDeriv ℝ j (fun y => rotationMap (PhysicalGraphBounds.liftXY y)) x‖ ≤ C"
